<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7438" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναρχ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without head</i> or
				<i>chief,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.703
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτικὸν στράτευμ᾽ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					914
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hec.</u>
				607
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ζῷα,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑφ᾽ ἡγεμόνα ὄντα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				488a11
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἄ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρχία</span>
			, A <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				696
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος ἄ.</span> a year <i>without any
				regular magistrates</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5635
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Teos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>holding no office</i> or <i>magistracy,</i> prob.
			l. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				4.6.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>not qualified to hold office,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Max.
			</span></i> Tyr. <i><span class="en">
				21.5
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			, s. v. l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>without beginning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				8.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ocell.
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.312
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος ἄ. καὶ ἀτελεύτητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					146
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLips.</u>
					33 ii 5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>without first principles,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.180
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
